# === CAPTAIN ===

~ boarding
## The captain greets the player. Keep it short.
Captain: Welcome aboard! [#mood=happy] [ID:BOARD_1]
Deckhand: Tickets, please. [#mood=tired]
| Captain: Don't mind him. [#mood=happy]
The engines rumble.
# Whether the player paid.
- Show the ticket [if has_flag("ticket")] [ID:BOARD_SHOW]
	Deckhand: All good. [#mood=tired]
	do set_flag("boarded")
- Sneak past
	Captain: I saw that! [#mood=angry, thought]
	=> caught
- Leave => END
if has_flag("boarded")
	Captain: Enjoy the trip, {{player_name}}.
else
	Captain: [[Hm|Well]], suit yourself.
=> crossing

~ caught
Captain: Off my *boat*. [#mood=angry]
=> END!

~ crossing
% Gull: Squawk.
%2 Gull: Squawk squawk.
match weather()
	when "storm"
		Captain: Hold on! [#mood=angry]
	else
		Captain: Smooth sailing. [#mood=calm]
set crossed = true
=> END
